BT 1 0 0 1 0 30.5 Tm /F1 9.1 Tf 13.2 TL (Agriculture depends on healthy plant growth, which requires essential nutrients such as nitrogen \(N\), phosphorus \(P\),) Tj T* (potassium \(K\), calcium \(Ca\), magnesium \(Mg\), and iron \(Fe\). When plants lack nutrients, visible symptoms may) Tj T* (appear, including leaf yellowing, discoloration, brown spots, leaf-edge damage, and stunted growth.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.84 678.7298 cm
q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 30.5 Tm /F1 9.1 Tf 13.2 TL (This project proposes an Artificial Intelligence \(AI\)-based system that analyzes plant-leaf images to identify likely) Tj T* (nutrient deficiencies. Using computer vision and deep learning, the system will classify leaf images and provide an) Tj T* (initial indication of the possible deficiency, together with general guidance for further checking and corrective action.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.84 650.7298 cm
q
.090196 .290196 .207843 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 3.5 Tm /F2 13.5 Tf 17 TL (2. Problem Statement) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.84 605.1298 cm
q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 30.5 Tm /F1 9.1 Tf 13.2 TL (Farmers and growers may find it difficult to identify plant nutrient deficiencies accurately and at an early stage. Visual) Tj T* (symptoms can be subtle, and different nutrient deficiencies may look similar. Manual inspection depends on) Tj T* (experience, while laboratory analysis may take time and may not always be readily available.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.84 546.3298 cm
q
BT 1 0 0 1 0 43.7 Tm 13.2 TL /F2 9.1 Tf 0 0 0 rg (Problem:) Tj /F1 9.1 Tf ( There is a need for an accessible, consistent, and efficient preliminary screening tool that can analyze) Tj T* -0.074459 Tw (plant-leaf images, identify likely nutrient-stress categories, and provide understandable guidance. The proposed system) Tj T* 0 Tw (will address this need using AI-based image classification. It will not replace soil or plant-tissue testing where) Tj T* (confirmation is needed.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.84 518.3298 cm
q
.090196 .290196 .207843 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 3.5 Tm /F2 13.5 Tf 17 TL (3. Project Objectives) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.84 433.1298 cm
q
BT 1 0 0 1 0 70.1 Tm 13.2 TL /F1 9.1 Tf 0 0 0 rg (\177 Develop an AI-based system to analyze plant-leaf images.) Tj  T* (\177 Classify selected nutrient-deficiency categories and healthy leaves.) Tj  T* (\177 Explore CNN and transfer-learning models for image classification.) Tj  T* (\177 Display the predicted category and model confidence score.) Tj  T* (\177 Provide general, crop-aware guidance on possible next steps.) Tj  T* (\177 Evaluate the model using suitable performance measures.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
