BT 1 0 0 1 0 43.7 Tm /F1 9.1 Tf 13.2 TL (The user will capture or upload a photograph of a plant leaf through a simple application. The image will be) Tj T* (preprocessed and passed to a trained deep-learning model. The model will return the most likely class among the) Tj T* (categories included in its training data. The application will then display the result, confidence score, and relevant) Tj T* (explanatory information.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
