BT 1 0 0 1 0 30.5 Tm /F1 9.1 Tf 13.2 TL (A labeled dataset containing healthy leaves and examples of selected nutrient deficiencies is divided into training,) Tj T* (validation, and test sets. A Convolutional Neural Network \(CNN\), or a transfer-learning model such as MobileNetV2, is) Tj T* (trained to learn visual patterns associated with each class.) Tj T* ET
