BT 1 0 0 1 0 56.9 Tm /F1 9.1 Tf 13.2 TL (The AI-Based Plant Nutrition Deficiency Detection System proposes the use of deep learning and computer vision to) Tj T* (identify likely nutrient deficiencies from plant-leaf images. By providing a preliminary classification, confidence score,) Tj T* (and understandable guidance, the system aims to support faster and more informed crop-health assessment. Further) Tj T* (research into multi-nutrient detection, explainable AI, early prediction, and improved datasets could increase its) Tj T* (usefulness and reliability.) Tj T* ET
